  "content": "\n\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/wishful-recipes\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/4xVp9RM1/wishcraft(2).png\" alt=\"本模组已并入 Wishful Recipes。请点击此处查看。它可独立动态生成配方，因此与其他模组兼容性极高，且配置需求更少。\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/kJdiggR.png\" alt=\"标题\"></p>\n<h5 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/2CUh6gMuCt\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1027252425960198165?color=5b6ee1&label=Discord&style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fmars_\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/ko--fi-donate-FF5E5B?style=for-the-badge&logo=ko-fi&logoColor=white\" alt=\"通过 ko-fi 赞助我\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/blasting-clay-and-clay-balls\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/956343?color=F16436&logo=curseforge&logoColor=white&label=Curseforge&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"CurseForge\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fblasting-clay-and-clay-balls\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/blasting-clay-and-clay-balls?style=for-the-badge&logo=modrinth&logoColor=white&label=modrinth&color=00AF5C\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a> </strong></h5>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><br>此模组支持完全自定义配置，允许你在高炉中烧制黏土、黏土块和陶瓦的速度是普通熔炉的两倍。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/haJFk6e.png\" alt=\"\" height=\"270\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/i7ZQEF8.png\" alt=\"\" height=\"270\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/rmPI78y.png\" alt=\"\" height=\"270\"></p>\n<p><strong>配置</strong></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>你可以直接在游戏内配置此模组，或编辑实例文件夹中的 JSON 文件 <code>config/blastingclay.json</code>。请注意，任何更改都需要重启 Minecraft 才能生效。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>blasting_list</strong> - 字符串列表，每个字符串代表一个烧炼配方，指定输入物品、输出物品以及烧炼获得的经验值</p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/JNZ2GMV.png\"> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/deimos-fabric-forge-neoforge\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/83sD0W8.png\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fdeimos\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/j2GIPnt.png\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://url-shortener.curseforge.com/KRMk5\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/y3LiTfU.png\"></a></p>",
